 ### Enhancements
 
 -   `Tooltip.Provider`: Widen the types to accept all props of the equivalent `Tooltip.Provider` from `@base-ui/react` (types-only change) ([#78642](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/78642)).
